                <pb facs="0666" n="644" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v01/pg644"/>

                <head>267. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On November 20 and 21, 1961, Ambassador Galbraith conveyed his views on Viet-Nam
                    to President Kennedy in two telegrams which are printed in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States-Vietnam Relations, 1945-1967</hi>, Book
                    11, pages 406-409 and 410-418. See also <hi rendition="#italic">Galbraith,
                        Ambassador’s Journal</hi>, pages 250 ff.</p>
            </div>
